" role=\"listitem\" class=\"cms-item-subservices w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"/services/pool-remodeling-renovation-in-north-south-florida\" class=\"svc-subservicio\"><div class=\"item-subservice\"><img src=\"/images/subservices/integrated-spa-construction/icon-2.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-subservice\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"><div class=\"div-block-2\"><h3 class=\"heading-2\">Integrated Spa Remodeling</h3><div class=\"paragraph-mini\">Spa remodeling seamlessly integrated into existing pools for comfort and style.</div></div></div></a></div><div data-w-id=\"f2721b05-6e5e-044b-b7c9-7a2a8bd783b4\" role=\"listitem\" class=\"cms-item-subservices w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"/services/pool-remodeling-renovation-in-north-south-florida\" class=\"svc-subservicio\"><div class=\"item-subservice\"><img src=\"/images/subservices/pool-deck-hardscape-remodeling/icon-6remodeling.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-subservice\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"><div class=\"div-block-2\"><h3 class=\"heading-2\">Pool Deck &amp; Hardscape Remodeling</h3><div class=\"paragraph-mini\">Pool deck remodeling using pavers or concrete for safety and durability.</div></div></div></a></div></div></div><p class=\"svc-cierre\"><a href=\"#estimate\" class=\"button button-styles w-button\">Get a Free Estimate</a></p></div></div></section><section class=\"process-section\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container\"><div data-w-id=\"dce80844-cc8a-923f-8fa1-aa91c1419f9a\" class=\"process-header\"><h2>Our Custom Pool Build Process</h2><p data-w-id=\"dce80844-cc8a-923f-8fa1-aa91c1419f9d\">Our pool builders guide your project from 3D design to final installation, delivering code-compliant custom pools across North &amp; South Florida.</p></div><div class=\"process-steps-nav\"><div class=\"process-step-wrapper w-dyn-list\"><div role=\"list\" class=\"process-step-list w-dyn-items\"><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"process-step-item w-dyn-item\"><div class=\"process-step-header\"><div class=\"tab-circle\"><div class=\"step-number\">1</div></div></div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"process-step-item w-dyn-item\"><div class=\"process-step-header\"><div class=\"tab-circle\"><div class=\"step-number\">2</div></div></div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"process-step-item w-dyn-item\"><div class=\"process-step-header\"><div class=\"tab-circle\"><div class=\"step-number\">3</div></div></div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"process-step-item w-dyn-item\"><div class=\"process-step-header\"><div class=\"tab-circle\"><div class=\"step-number\">4</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"line-bar\"></div></div><div class=\"process-content-wrapper w-dyn-list\"><div role=\"list\" class=\"process-content-list w-dyn-items\"><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"process-content-item w-dyn-item\"><div class=\"process-step\"><div class=\"image-step-tab\"><img alt=\"Start your custom pool project in Florida with a personalized consultation, detailed estimate, and material selections. Mr &amp; Mrs Outdoor Living guides you every step of the way.\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/procesos/pool-construction-step-1/pool-construction-step-1.png\" class=\"img-process\" width=\"1408\" height=\"768\"></div><div class=\"content-step-tab\"><div class=\"wrapper-vertical-text\"><h2>Site Assessment &amp; Structural Evaluation</h2><div class=\"text-divider\"><div class=\"w-richtext\"><p>Comprehensive evaluation of lot configuration, soil stability, and hydrostatic pressure zones using 3D surveying technology. We assess setback requirements per Florida Building Code Chapter 45, HOA restrictions, and geotechnical conditions to determine engineering specifications.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"process-content-item w-dyn-item\"><div class=\"process-step\"><div class=\"image-step-tab\"><img alt=\"Our licensed pool builders prepare full engineering drawings and manage all permits with your Florida municipality — keeping your custom pool project on schedule and fully code-compliant.\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/procesos/pool-construction-step-2/pool-construction-step-2-v2.png\" class=\"img-process\" width=\"1408\" height=\"768\"></div><div class=\"content-step-tab\"><div class=\"wrapper-vertical-text\"><h2>Design Consultation &amp; 3D Rendering</h2><div class=\"text-divider\"><div class=\"w-richtext\"><p>Custom design consultation creating detailed 3D architectural renderings showing pool shape, depth variations, spa integration, and surrounding deck configurations. Our licensed designers present multiple options for approval before construction begins.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"process-content-item w-dyn-item\"><div class=\"process-step\"><div class=\"image-step-tab\"><img alt=\"Expert pool excavation, steel rebar, gunite application, tile, coping, decking, and full equipment installation by licensed pool contractors in North &amp; South Florida.\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/procesos/pool-construction-step-3/pool-construction-step-3-v2.png\" class=\"img-process\" width=\"1408\" height=\"768\"></div><div class=\"content-step-tab\"><div class=\"wrapper-vertical-text\"><h2>Permits &amp; Regulatory Compliance</h2><div class=\"text-divider\"><div class=\"w-richtext\"><p>Comprehensive permit acquisition including Notice of Commencement (NOC), VGB compliance certification, and ARB approvals if applicable. We manage all interactions with county building departments and HOA review boards to ensure seamless approval.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"process-content-item w-dyn-item\"><div class=\"process-step\"><div class=\"image-step-tab\"><img alt=\"Premium interior plaster is applied, your new pool is filled and balanced, and every system is tested. Your custom Florida pool is complete and ready to enjoy from day one.\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/procesos/pool-construction-step-4/pool-construction-step-4.png\" class=\"img-process\" width=\"1408\" height=\"768\"></div><div class=\"content-step-tab\"><div class=\"wrapper-vertical-text\"><h2>Construction &amp; Installation</h2><div class=\"text-divider\"><div class=\"w-richtext\"><p>Full construction execution including gunite shell application with pneumatic concrete, hydrostatic pressure management systems, bond coat application, plaster finishes, equipment installation, and final inspections with CPC licensing.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"w-embed w-script\"><script>\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {\n\n  const AUTOPLAY_DELAY = 5000;\n\n  const COLOR_ACTIVE   = '#001C63';\n  const COLOR_INACTIVE = '#D99933';\n\n  const dots  = document.querySelectorAll('.process-step-item');\n  const steps = document.querySelectorAll('.process-content-item');\n\n  if (!dots.length || !steps.length) return;\n\n  let currentStep = 0;\n  let autoTimer   = null;\n  let isAnimating = false;\n\n  function goToStep(index) {\n    if (isAnimating) return;\n    isAnimating = true;\n\n    const prevStep = currentStep;\n    currentStep = index;\n\n    // ── 1. Actualizar DOTS (nav) ──────────────────────────\n    dots.forEach(function (dot, i) {\n      const circle = dot.querySelector('.tab-circle, [class*=\"tab-circle\"], [class*=\"Tab-Circle\"]');\n      const number = dot.querySelector('[class*=\"step-number\"], [class*=\"Step-Number\"]'); // ✅ DENTRO de goToStep\n\n      if (!circle) return;\n\n      if (i === currentStep) {\n        circle.style.background = COLOR_ACTIVE;\n        circle.style.transform  = 'scale(1.15)';\n        circle.style.boxShadow  = '0 4px 16px rgba(0,28,99,0.25)';\n        circle.style.transition = 'all 0.35s ease';\n        if (number) number.style.color = '#FFFFFF'; // ✅ Blanco activo\n      } else {\n        circle.style.background = COLOR_INACTIVE;\n        circle.style.transform  = 'scale(1)';\n        circle.style.boxShadow  = 'none';\n        circle.style.transition = 'all 0.35s ease';\n        if (number) number.style.color = '#001C63'; // ✅ Navy inactivo\n      }\n    });\n\n    // ── 2. Animar salida del paso anterior ────────────────\n    if (steps[prevStep] && prevStep !== currentStep) {\n      const outEl = steps[prevStep];\n      outEl.style.transition = 'opacity 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease';\n      outEl.style.opacity    = '0';\n      outEl.style.transform  = 'translateY(-10px)';\n\n      setTimeout(function () {\n        outEl.style.display = 'none';\n        showCurrentStep();\n      }, 300);\n    } else {\n      showCurrentStep();\n    }\n  }\n\n  function showCurrentStep() {\n    steps.forEach(function (s) {\n      s.style.display = 'none';\n      s.style.opacity = '0';\n    });\n\n    const activeEl = steps[currentStep];\n    if (!activeEl) { isAnimating = false; return; }\n\n    activeEl.style.display   = 'flex';\n    activeEl.style.transform = 'translateY(12px)';\n    activeEl.style.opacity   = '0';\n\n    void activeEl.offsetWidth;\n\n    activeEl.style.transition = 'opacity 0.4s ease, transform 0.4s ease';\n    activeEl.style.opacity    = '1';\n    activeEl.style.transform  = 'translateY(0)';\n\n    setTimeout(function () { isAnimating = false; }, 420);\n  }\n\n  function startAutoplay() {\n    stopAutoplay();\n    autoTimer = setInterval(function () {\n      const next = (currentStep + 1) % dots.length;\n      goToStep(next);\n    }, AUTOPLAY_DELAY);\n  }\n\n  function stopAutoplay() {\n    if (autoTimer) { clearInterval(autoTimer); autoTimer = null; }\n  }\n\n  dots.forEach(function (dot, i) {\n    dot.style.cursor = 'pointer';\n    dot.addEventListener('click', function () {\n      if (i === currentStep) return;\n      stopAutoplay();\n      goToStep(i);\n      startAutoplay();\n    });\n  });\n\n  const section = document.querySelector('.process-section');\n  if (section) {\n    section.addEventListener('mouseenter', stopAutoplay);\n    section.addEventListener('mouseleave', startAutoplay);\n  }\n\n  goToStep(0);\n  startAutoplay();\n\n});\n</script></div></div><img sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"/images/site/design3-p-500.webp 500w, /images/site/design3-p-800.webp 800w, /images/site/design3-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/site/design3-p-1600.webp 1600w, /images/site/design3.webp 1920w\" alt=\"\" src=\"/images/site/design3.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"design-bg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"255\"></section>";
const T8 = "<section class=\"faq-section\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container\"><div data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bc3\" class=\"header-faq\"><h2>Custom Pool Construction FAQs</h2><div>Have questions about custom pool construction in Florida? Our licensed pool builders answer the most common questions from Florida homeowners below.</div></div><div class=\"wrapper-faq-components\"><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bc7\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Do custom pool installations increase home value in Florida?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Yes. Custom pool installation can increase Florida home value by approximately 7% while significantly enhancing lifestyle appeal and outdoor livability. Licensed under CPC1461119 and CPC1460562, Mr. &amp; Mrs. Outdoor Living builds permitted pools that carry full documentation of code compliance — a key factor in Florida real estate transactions.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bcf\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">What pool and spa design options are available?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">We offer fully custom pool designs with flexible shapes, depths, and integrated features including attached spas, tanning ledges, waterfalls, LED lighting systems, and swim-up bars. Every design begins with a full 3D architectural rendering so you can visualize the finished pool before construction begins.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bd7\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Are custom pools in Florida low-maintenance?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Modern pool systems equipped with variable-speed pumps, saltwater generators, and automated controllers significantly reduce the time and cost of pool ownership in Florida. Smart filtration and chemical automation handle routine tasks, so homeowners spend less time on upkeep and more time enjoying their custom pool year-round.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bdf\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">How long does pool construction take in Florida?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Custom pool construction in Florida typically takes three to six months from permit approval through final start-up. Our licensed pool builders manage every phase — from excavation and gunite through plumbing, electrical, and plastering — coordinating county inspections to keep your project on schedule.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077be7\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Can I finance a custom pool project in Florida?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Yes. We connect Florida homeowners with lending partners, and the order matters: you get your design and a fixed project price in writing first, and only then review how to pay for it. Approval and terms come from the lender.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">How much does a custom pool cost in North Florida?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">There is no single number: a custom pool is priced from its own design, size, finishes and site conditions. Our estimator walks you through the choices that move the price, and you get a fixed project price in writing before you commit.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Who pulls the permits for a pool in Florida?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">We do. Permitting and code compliance are part of the build: we prepare the submittal, pull the permits and coordinate the county inspections through to final start-up.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">What is included in a custom pool project?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Design and 3D rendering, engineering, permitting, excavation, the gunite shell, plumbing and circulation, electrical and equipment, interior finish, tile and coping, the deck, and final start-up.</p></nav></div></div></div><img sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"/images/site/design2-p-500.webp 500w, /images/site/design2-p-800.webp 800w, /images/site/design2-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/site/design2-p-1600.webp 1600w, /images/site/design2.webp 1920w\" alt=\"\" src=\"/images/site/design2.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"design-bg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"146\"></section></div><section class=\"location\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container\"><div data-w-id=\"dfdd7317-58e7-27b3-99a6-2c20a5e8a7be\" class=\"header-location\"><h2>Where We Serve</h2><p>Regional Coverage With National Vision</p></div></div><div class=\"cms-country w-dyn-list\"><div role=\"list\" class=\"cms-list-country w-dyn-items\"><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"item-country w-dyn-item\"><img src=\"/images/where-we-serves/custom-pool-builders-north-florida/service-areas-north-south-florida-pools.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Service areas map showing North Florida coverage for luxury custom pool builders and outdoor living services.\" class=\"full-image-background\" width=\"1250\" height=\"938\"><div data-w-id=\"dfdd7317-58e7-27b3-99a6-2c20a5e8a7c8\" class=\"block-info-country\"><h3 class=\"white\">North Florida</h3><p>Licensed luxury pool builders in North Florida specializing in custom inground pools and outdoor living design-build projects, engineered for structural integrity and long-term durability.</p><a href=\"/where-we-serve/north-florida\" class=\"button button-styles w-button\">View North Florida Service Areas</a></div></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"item-country w-dyn-item\"><img src=\"/images/where-we-serves/custom-pool-builders-south-florida/custom-inground-pool-builders-remodeling-florida.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Aerial drone view of a luxury custom pool and outdoor living project in South Florida, showcasing modern pool design by expert custom pool builders.\" class=\"full-image-background\" width=\"1250\" height=\"938\"><div data-w-id=\"dfdd7317-58e7-27b3-99a6-2c20a5e8a7c8\" class=\"block-info-country\"><h3 class=\"white\">South Florida</h3><p>Licensed luxury pool builders in South Florida specializing in custom inground pools and outdoor living design-build projects, engineered, permitted, and built for high-end residential properties.</p><a href=\"/where-we-serve/south-florida\" class=\"button button-styles w-button\">View South Florida Service Areas</a></div></div></div></div></section>";
